              <tr><td class="py-2 pr-3">Hypothecation not cleared</td><td class="py-2">Transaction blocked until resolved</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-serif text-navy-900 mt-12 mb-4">Maruti resale value by segment: hatchback, sedan, SUV and MPV retention curves compared</h2>

        <p>Hatchbacks lose the most in Year 1 and then flatten. Compact SUVs lose less early but decline more steadily year on year. MPVs hold longest because of the fleet demand layer. Mid-size sedans decline earliest and do not flatten.</p>

